total() multiplied by (1 - discount) twice: once together with the bulk
discount and once more when rounding. Apply the customer discount once,
then the bulk discount once, and round once at the end.

The expression keeps the same order of multiplication, so totals with a
discount rate of 0 (including wholesale invoices, which call total()
without a discount) are unchanged.

Tests: rate 0.1 on 1,000 yen below 10 lines -> 900; 9 lines -> no bulk
discount; 10 lines / 10,000 yen -> 8,550.

